e.cl/r4/ValueSet/icd11-mms-es#icd11-mms-es-QC04.467\">QC04.7</a></td><td>Immunization not carried out due to lack of availability</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx.hl7chile.cl/r4/ValueSet/icd11-mms-es#icd11-mms-es-QC04.46Y\">QC04.Y</a></td><td>Immunization not carried out for other reasons</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://tx.hl7chile.cl/r4/ValueSet/icd11-mms-es#icd11-mms-es-QC04.46Z\">QC04.Z</a></td><td>Immunization not carried out for unspecified reason</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
